{"ErrorMessage":null,"FrienlyMessage":null,"Data":{"Metadata":{"component_title":"Physicians (Per 1,000 Population) - Annually","component_title_ar":"الأطباء (لكل 1,000 من السكان) - سنوي","component_subtitle":"This indicator measures the number of physicians per 1,000 population in the Emirate of Abu Dhabi. Physicians (Medical doctors): Physicians study, diagnose, treat and prevent illness, disease, injury and other physical and mental impairments in humans through the application of the principles and procedures of medicine. Population Size: It is defined as the sum of individuals within the boundaries of the State at a given date, whether they are citizens or permanent or temporary residents. The population size is usually estimated for a specific year in the middle of that year.","component_subtitle_ar":"يقيس هذا المؤشر عدد الأطباء لكل 1,000 السكان في إمارة أبوظبي. طبيب (دكتور): هو الشخص الذي يحمل درجة في الطب ومرخص مهنيًا لتقديم خدمات مباشرة للمرضى كمستهلكين للرعاية الصحية. حجم السكان: مجموع الأفراد القاطنين ضمن حدود الدولة في تاريخ معين سواء كانوا يتمتعون بصفة المواطنة للدولة أم كانوا مقيمين إقامة دائمة أو مؤقتة. ويقدر حجم السكان عادة لسنة معينة في منتصف هذه السنة.","data_source":"SCAD Official","updated":"2026-06-28T00:00:00"},"MetaDataAndMethodology":null,"Properties":"","Configuration":[{"id":"line-chart-a1794522970160959","type":"line-chart","indicatorId":"3997","seriesMeta":[{"type":"solid","xAccessor":{"type":"date","path":"OBS_DT","specifier":"%Y-%m-%d"},"yAccessor":{"type":"value","path":"VALUE"},"id":"a1794522970160959","dbIndicatorId":"3997","label":null,"color":"#000000"}],"tooltipTitleFormat":"date_MMM y","tooltipValueFormat":"number_1.1-2","xAxisFormat":"date_y","yAxisFormat":"number_1.1-2","xAxisLabel":"","yAxisLabel":"Physician per 1,000 population","viewName":"VW_STATISTICAL_INDICATORS","markersMeta":[],"dbColumn":"INDICATOR_ID","relatedSV":[],"yAxisLabel_ar":"طبيب لكل 1000 من السكان","dimension":false,"componentTitle":"Physicians (Per 1,000 Pop